Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（英格兰北部 约克郡 庞蒂弗拉克特城堡）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.35,0:23:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（温莎城堡）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.94,0:26:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（约克大教堂）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王即将驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King approaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣驾将至\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}预备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}立正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.46,0:02:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉尔夫爵士 各位大人以及先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Ralph, my lords and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.43,0:02:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢上帝 我终于能来到北部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank God at last, I have been able to come among.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来到约克郡 来到我忠实的仆人中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}my faithful servants in Yorkshire and the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我介绍我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce my wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.63,0:02:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 凯瑟琳王后 - 王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Queen Katherine. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.52,0:02:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们已见过我的长女 玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know my eldest daughter, the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您好 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎陛下以及各位大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesties, and all those with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}光临庞蒂弗拉克特城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}are welcome to Pontefract Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信此行将使你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust your stay here will bring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愉悦欢喜 获利良多\N{\fnArial\fs30}both pleasure and profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 拉尔夫爵士 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir Ralph. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.01,0:02:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Culpepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚我要与王后共寝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will sleep with the Queen tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 带她来见我 - 遵旨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bring her to me. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人 国王看起来精神抖擞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King seems in good spirits, your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉尔夫爵士 陛下圣体十分安康\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty is very well, Sir Ralph.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.59,0:03:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后新娶 壮志又起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has both a new Queen and it seems a new lease on life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此处诸事进展顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}His progress here has been joyful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四方之民蜂拥俱至竭诚恭迎圣驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowds have come out to cheer him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显赫之士发表演说极尽赞美之辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and eminent men have made speeches to praise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不久还会有人前来恭迎圣驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be men come here too, now and in a while…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.73,0:03:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是那些曾揭竿造反的叛逆之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}men who once wore the emblem of…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现到此以示悔恨羞愧之意\N{\fnArial\fs30}rebellion came now to express their shame for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向右转 撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right men, pull out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 欢迎回到庞蒂弗拉克特城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back to Pontefract Castle, your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.11,0:03:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恕我冒昧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.28,0:03:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}故地重游 此情此景一定使大人忆起往昔\N{\fnArial\fs30}These walls must remind your Grace of other times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉尔夫爵士 我不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must confess to you, Sir Ralph,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幽灵鬼魅回荡于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this hall is filled with ghostly presences.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}故人旧事实难忘怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I should rather forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说也是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道他卑颜屈膝投靠叛贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he was an arch traitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但达西大人 老汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my Lord Darcy-Old Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎仍在城垛间盘桓\N{\fnArial\fs30}he still seems to haunt these battlements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:03:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我内心矛盾 仍希望在就寝之时见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I half expect to see him on my way to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你以诚相告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, truly:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.44,0:04:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有圣人 没有信仰 没有修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do the people cope here without their saints,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.61,0:04:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此处民众何以为生\N{\fnArial\fs30}their superstitions, their monasteries?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}壁龛空无一物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教堂烛台不再 亦无对逝者的祷告之音\N{\fnArial\fs30}who still grumble at the empty niches in the churches,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仍有少数人对此心存怨言\N{\fnArial\fs30}the absence of candles and prayers for the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但自秘书大臣克伦威尔被斩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it seems with the death of Secretary Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}复辟的热情似乎也逐渐消退\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the reforming zeal has slackened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或又是如何 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or has it? No one knows, your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下是要继续弃圣坛于不顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether the King means to continue stripping the altars,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是回归旧道 这无人知晓\N{\fnArial\fs30}or return to the old ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}民众常惧于开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are often afraid to open their mouths,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生怕祸从口出\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case they should say the wrong thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.54,0:04:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}君心难测 拉尔夫爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not always easy to read the King's mind, Sir Ralph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 罗彻福德夫人 - 卡尔佩珀大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Rochford. - Master Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下准备好接见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty is ready to receive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等会见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 王后驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, the Queen is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚听闻罗马皇帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have just heard that the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和法兰西国王关系紧张 一触即发\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the King of France are on the brink of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下一定觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely your Majesty does not want to see me…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此时见我不合时宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}at… such a time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您还有要事在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have more important matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.55,0:05:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会比你还重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}More important than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他们开战去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them have their war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.35,0:07:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可知何人曾命丧于这座城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who died here, in this castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我是指重要人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Important men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查二世被废黜后 就死于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard the Second died here, after he was deposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.69,0:07:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他当时年仅33岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was 33 years of age.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.05,0:07:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们将他囚禁于此 活活饿死了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kept him here as a prisoner. They starved him to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的亡魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他错就错在亲近少数派\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made the mistake of favouring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疏远了多数派\N{\fnArial\fs30}lesser men over greater ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.73,0:07:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此大家才决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}For such mean creatures are determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅要篡夺王权\N{\fnArial\fs30}not just to usurp the nobility,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.29,0:07:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还要将我们贵族一同毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to destroy us altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 也许有时候的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, my Lord, it may be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.03,0:07:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但陛下所赐官职和地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}But surely the King is right where he gives offices.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是给了受之无愧之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dignities to those with the right qualities?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 陛下提拔的那帮贱民\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Those men that are made by the King of vile birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玷污了我们贵族的高贵血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been the distraction of all the nobility of this realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要陛下魂归天命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if God calls away the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.43,0:08:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他们便会为此付出代价 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They will suffer for it! - My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.47,0:08:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当心 别诅咒陛下的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}be careful not to wish the King's life away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是叛国之罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is treason!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你朋友萨里大人正咒骂你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your friend Surrey is snarling at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty, the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 这位是西维尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sidwell, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 作为您卑微的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, we your humble servants confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我等贱民承认 我们的叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we wretches have most grievously, wantonly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实属不忠 不孝 不义之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}and heinously offended your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且无理 无序 无情地\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the most unnatural, odious, and distasteful acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.95,0:10:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冒犯了陛下的盛威\N{\fnArial\fs30}of outrageous disobedience and traitorous rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:11:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若陛下仍余怒未消\N{\fnArial\fs30}We beg your Majesty to rid your mind of any relics of indignation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.29,0:11:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我等谨请陛下息怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might still harbour against us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日后定当每日为陛下祈福\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we pray henceforward to pray ceaselessly for your preservation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为您的王后 您的子嗣 爱德华王子祈福\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for that of your queen and of your son, the Prince Edward,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿万能的上帝保佑我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}so God Almighty help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.65,0:11:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对汝等并无怒意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I harbour no relics of indignation against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且 鉴于你们现在的忠心表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for these shows of loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.81,0:11:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原谅你们的一切罪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you all your trespasses against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽·都铎女士驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lady Mary Tudor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.35,0:12:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽女士 上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary, God bless you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady! My Lady! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless Lady Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿汝等为陛下祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to say a prayer for his Grace, the King's Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.45,0:12:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿陛下的统治绵延万世\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pray for his Majesty's long and blessed reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿陛下万寿无疆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for his good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.51,0:12:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以圣母玛丽亚之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the name of the Blessed Virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.50,0:12:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她唯一的儿子为了我们的罪过而殉难\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose only Son died in agony for our sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以圣父圣子和圣灵之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the name of the Father, Son,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保佑你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Holy Ghost, I bless all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.13,0:12:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都会好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}All shall be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切终会重回正轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}All manner of things shall be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.15,0:12:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赞美上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benedictus Deus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.48,0:13:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless his Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都铎王朝 亘古长存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live the house of Tudor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要做…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一只山鹬\N{\fnArial\fs30}a woodcock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.91,0:13:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}选得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.51,0:13:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为它是只雄鸟（亦指男性生殖器）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's a cock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.98,0:13:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is him, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗兰西斯·迪尔罕先生 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Francis Dereham, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.15,0:13:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪尔罕先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 请叫我弗兰西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francis, please… your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.73,0:14:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为何来此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why have you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.39,0:14:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来呈交此物予陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵夫人的引荐信\N{\fnArial\fs30}A letter of recommendation from the Dowager Duchess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您还记得公爵夫人吧 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember the Duchess, don't you, your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.03,0:14:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要这信有何用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you need such a letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若我有心仕途\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你理应举荐我\N{\fnArial\fs30}is obligatory if one is seeking employment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看过信就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you read it, you will see that since.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和你一别之后 我在公爵夫人家\N{\fnArial\fs30}we last met I have held a number of responsible positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}担任过不少要职\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Duchess's household,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她对我赞不绝口\N{\fnArial\fs30}for which she freely commends me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯 让我举荐你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not possible for me to offer you employment…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不大可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}服侍你的人一定不能少\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must keep a large establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你需要文书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you have a secretary?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会做得很出色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would make an excellent secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为何不能任用你 你心里清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you can understand why I cannot offer you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你任用了琼·布尔默吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you employed Joan Bulmer, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.07,0:14:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她知道得不比我少\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she knows what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:15:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你何必厚此薄彼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看是你的侍女宣我觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was bound to notice that one of your ladies announced me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你难道没有侍从吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean you have no usher for your chamber?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以您的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very sure you ought to,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.45,0:15:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理应需要侍从\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您当然可以 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.34,0:15:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您毕竟是英格兰的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are, after all, the Queen of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您可以为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do as you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要谨言慎行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take care what words you speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.96,0:15:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 法国大使到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, the French Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大使先生 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excellency! - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.21,0:15:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信阁下定会向贵国王上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you will not forget to convey to your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}转达今日所见之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you have seen here today:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之前那上千名暴民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of former rebels come to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向他们认定的国王忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}their supplication to their anointed King!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.79,0:16:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此等大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我定当禀报吾王\N{\fnArial\fs30}convey these tremendous events to his Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 今日之事足以让他明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You will tell him, based on what you have seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.73,0:16:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}企图以宗教分歧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it would be foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}煽动无知民众闹事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to contemplate an invasion of this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}趁机攻打我国\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the mistaken belief that it is riven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实属不智之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}with religious discord and full of discontented men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我担保\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I am very sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾王绝无此意\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my master has no such plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恰恰相反 吾王将英格兰视为\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, he regards England as his natural ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.01,0:16:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对抗罗马帝国的天生盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.70,0:16:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿如阁下所言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人 约克一行准备如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace, what preparations are made for our visit to York?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.73,0:16:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回陛下 议院已在圣玛丽旧教堂为您打点妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, chambers are being made ready for your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.31,0:16:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并将陛下所用挂毯和餐具\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the former abbey of St. Mary, and furnished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:17:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由伦敦运至此处\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your Majesty's tapestries and plate brought from London.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随侍之人会在教堂内驻扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tents are also being erected in the Abbey grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以护您周全\N{\fnArial\fs30}to accommodate your court.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹姆士国王驾临后也是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that of King James's court when he arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宝贝儿 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很好 多谢陛下关怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am well, thank you… your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要禀告陛下 我今日在自己宫中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must tell your Majesty that today I appointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.53,0:17:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新任命了一位文书兼侍从\N{\fnArial\fs30}a new Private Secretary and Usher to my Chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 你想现在颁布诏命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you write letters now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您允许吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 我对你说过 尽可随心所欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not. I've told you: you must do what you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后 恭祝您身体健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, your good health!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:17:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琼 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仿佛回到从前吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like old times?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今非昔比 弗朗西斯 你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}These times is different, Francis. You know that very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想想看啊 琼 我们的小凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just imagine, Joanie! Our Kate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今竟成了英格兰的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}our little Katie is Queen of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:18:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不再是我们的小凯特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not our Kate anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她已嫁做人妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}She belongs to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是国王的女人 你最好记住这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}She belongs to the King, and don't you forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你别打什么主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever get any ideas into that mind of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说什么你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know very well what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.77,0:19:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯 往事不再\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those days are over, Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.49,0:19:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.66,0:19:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今过得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a good living.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这曾是你我梦寐以求的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the highest living you or I could ever dream of!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝份儿上 别毁了这份幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, don't spoil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为我们俩 也为了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for us and not for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.18,0:19:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我睡哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… where am I to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不睡这里 不和我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here. Not with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.31,0:19:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}For heaven's sake…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要和国王的侍从住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must ask the King's chamberlain for a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.16,0:19:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过是个吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.05,0:20:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为老朋友的情谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}For old times' sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.15,0:21:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}达西大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Darcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.37,0:21:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 但却未得安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes… but not yet at rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}活着的人未能觉察\N{\fnArial\fs30}The living don't know that the recent dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近来总有亡魂萦绕\N{\fnArial\fs30}are always around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们到处忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go here and there, to do penance,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以佑周围亲人平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make sure our relatives are well,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后我们才能安心上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we await our second death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何来找我说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you appear to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是已死之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am among the Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终日与那些曾遭你弑戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have joined the ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或曾蒙你恩泽的亡灵为伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all your victims, your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.45,0:21:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不必太过悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do not grieve too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:22:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其境遇 亦非凄苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}for they are not bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.43,0:22:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管孩子们曾整日无虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the children think of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.24,0:22:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但欢快忘忧的童年终会止步\N{\fnArial\fs30}but stopping this endless motion,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嬉闹玩耍的岁月也终会落幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}this rushing here and there,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一如曾经葱嵘尘世间的你我\N{\fnArial\fs30}like doubles of our earthly selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.88,0:22:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当年华老去 恩仇泯逝之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we have settled all our accounts,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.40,0:22:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天使终会带着我们埋骨天国\N{\fnArial\fs30}the angels will come to take us to the place of rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.12,0:22:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你不要再缠着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you had not bothered me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但此刻 我不愿让你离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I would not have you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.13,0:22:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并非真的在你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.61,0:22:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我能看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.73,0:22:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能听见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.11,0:22:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是达西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Darcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是达西 我是虚无的魂魄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not Darcy! I am nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.34,0:22:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你伸出手来摸我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you reached out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摸到的 就只有空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}to touch me, it would find only air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.30,0:22:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉 我背叛了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry that I betrayed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.83,0:22:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.74,0:22:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生者是如此自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}The living are so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只顾及自己的得失\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can think of nothing but themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.29,0:23:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]如我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui mihi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}少壮不努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}discipulus puer es…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.77,0:23:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如我少壮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui mihi… dis…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.47,0:23:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.80,0:23:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在凑近些听\N{\fnArial\fs30}now listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.31,0:23:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有一位家庭教师\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you have a tutor,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.50,0:23:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定要跟她学习这些知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to learn these things, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉丁语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cupis atque…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.85,0:23:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉丁语\N{\fnArial\fs30}doceri… Cupis…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.28,0:23:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉丁语\N{\fnArial\fs30}atque doc…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.30,0:24:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想出去玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go and play?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.86,0:24:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 如果你允许的话 姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, if it please you, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.62,0:24:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华 他日你定能成为伟大的国君\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day you will be a great King, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.50,0:24:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.26,0:24:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚毅果敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.40,0:24:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}且公正仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But also fair and merciful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.01,0:24:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我望你首先成为一名正直的君王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to be a just ruler,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.01,0:24:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那将是你成就一代明君的必经之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then indeed you shall be a great King.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.21,0:24:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 出去玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go along and play.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.43,0:24:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.79,0:24:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And God bless you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.65,0:25:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯·卡尔佩珀先生求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Thomas Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.76,0:25:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lady. Yes Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.58,0:25:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是弗朗西斯·迪尔罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Francis Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.13,0:25:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从何而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.35,0:25:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很久以前就认识他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew him a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.18,0:25:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都曾和公爵遗孀一起生活过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both lived with the Dowager Duchess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.87,0:25:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是她写信举荐他过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wrote to me recommending his services.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.15,0:25:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你了解他多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How well did you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.44,0:25:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底想说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.40,0:25:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对他 了解多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How well did you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.97,0:26:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们当时还小\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were children!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.64,0:26:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你早就不是孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were never a child. Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.10,0:26:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这你最清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.07,0:26:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.59,0:26:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别再用你的脏手碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever touch me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.48,0:26:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不知道我的身份吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.58,0:26:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是不清楚我的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what I could do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.82,0:26:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会认为自己是我的唯一吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think you're the only one, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.92,0:26:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如你这般的男宠 又何止十数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a store of other lovers beside you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.49,0:26:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 给我滚出去 滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.37,0:26:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.96,0:27:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.34,0:27:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.28,0:27:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大英帝国教会虔诚的神职人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devoted clergy of your Majesty's Church of England,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.59,0:27:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及约克郡各界名流贵绅\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the nobility and loyal gentlemen of York,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.81,0:27:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭迎陛下驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome you most heartily.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.44,0:27:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下对吾等过去所犯的恶劣罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}In gratitude for your Majesty's gracious pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.59,0:27:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宽仁慈厚 既往不咎\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our previous, and grievous, sins,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.85,0:27:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾等诚心请陛下收下这些金子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hope your Majesty will accept these purses of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.70,0:27:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.54,0:27:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢我主的恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thank your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.60,0:27:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢约克郡人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thank York!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.83,0:28:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为苏格兰国王的来访都安排妥当了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything prepared for the King of Scotland's visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.77,0:28:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.02,0:28:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹姆斯国王正在等待过境\N{\fnArial\fs30}King James is waiting across the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.69,0:28:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经派出信使 告知其境内保证一路安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have sent post horses and messages of reassurance to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何必如此 他害怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What is he afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.31,0:28:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他怕我们会杀了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he think we're going to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.01,0:28:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是同一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's the same one?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.90,0:28:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个曾在夜里来和她会面 她还曾对其许诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who visited her at night? To whom she was promised?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.29,0:28:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 就是同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my Lady. It's the same gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.06,0:28:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能用这个博您芳心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I interest you in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.44,0:28:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他变化不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has not changed much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.55,0:28:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一贯那么放肆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he always so familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就是那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.18,0:28:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.64,0:28:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再添些酒吗 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}More wine, my Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.81,0:29:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不必 谢谢 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Thank you. - Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.99,0:29:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就一点 再来点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little? One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.58,0:29:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说不必 迪尔罕先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said no, Mr. Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.20,0:29:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.67,0:29:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我主耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.14,0:29:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要就寝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.62,0:29:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.32,0:29:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 来吧 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Come, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.50,0:29:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.44,0:29:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪尔罕先生 我不知道您是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Dereham…I don't know who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.97,0:29:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但您无权对英国王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have no right to be so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.88,0:29:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此放肆\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the Queen of England!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不可在她面前出言亵渎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or blaspheme in her presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.71,0:29:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}菲尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fell,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.93,0:29:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对英国王后的了解 远远超过您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the Queen of England a great deal better than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.52,0:29:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么叫 我看未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean: "I don't think so"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.09,0:30:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她叫凯瑟琳·霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Katherine Howard,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.08,0:30:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认识她已经很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've known her a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.50,0:30:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们曾经过从甚密\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to be very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.28,0:30:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚密到你无法想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.24,0:30:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 可爱的爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, sweet Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.45,0:30:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱恩夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Bryan!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.19,0:30:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱恩夫人 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Bryan! Come quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.87,0:30:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他发烧了 摸摸他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a fever. Feel his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.65,0:30:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 快召医师 跑着去 - 是 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go fetch a physician. Run! - Yes Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.80,0:30:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 给赫福德大人捎个信 - 是 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Send a message to my Lord Hertford. - Yes my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.03,0:30:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor lamb!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.88,0:31:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的行为是十足的侮辱王威\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your behaviour is a complete outrage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.56,0:31:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要您发誓 迪尔罕先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to promise, Mr. Dereham,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.28,0:31:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发誓从现在起 您将不再口出任何\N{\fnArial\fs30}that from now on you will not speak of the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.39,0:31:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有辱王后陛下威仪的言语\N{\fnArial\fs30}in ways which offend her proper dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.99,0:31:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何来威仪可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.45,0:31:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想怎么说就怎么说她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall speak of her how I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.81,0:31:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但您绝不可如此放肆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you must not be so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.62,0:31:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放肆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.61,0:31:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 我跟她可熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I am very familiar with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.72,0:31:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God sake's, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.22,0:31:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您满口胡言乱语只会害了您自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bragging and your lies only harm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.22,0:31:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.86,0:31:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说我胡说 好吧 菲尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that I am lying? Let me tell you something, Mr. Fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.86,0:31:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对凯瑟琳·霍华德非常了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Katherine Howard well enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.22,0:31:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可把玩过她的私处\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I have had her by the cunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.10,0:31:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.89,0:31:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这只是我所熟知她的一小部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I would know it among a hundred others.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.40,0:31:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要你替我给他捎个口信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to give him a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.88,0:32:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给谁 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.33,0:32:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.04,0:32:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Culpepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.72,0:32:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 告诉他 我一定要见他 - 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell him… I must see him. - My Lady…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.68,0:32:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他有个通道可通我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him there is a way into my chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.37,0:32:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他明天来 等国王睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to come tomorrow, when the King is asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.77,0:32:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.97,0:32:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}类似第三级高烧 赫福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of tertiary fever, my Lord Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.53,0:32:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有危险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.87,0:32:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的性命是否堪忧 回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is his life in danger? Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.47,0:32:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果高烧不退 恐有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the fever persists, then perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.84,0:32:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还是有办法的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do have some remedies, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.84,0:32:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不要通知国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we tell the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.76,0:32:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.15,0:32:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倘若他决议缩短行程 尽快赶回\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he felt obliged to curtail his progress and hurry back,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.50,0:33:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果王子却生命垂危 这可如何是好\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to find the Prince quite recovered…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.44,0:33:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我治好他 看在上帝的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apply your remedies. For God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.55,0:33:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也为了国家的安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for the sake of peace in this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.99,0:33:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别让他撒手人寰\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't let him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.70,0:33:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.68,0:33:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他是他的表亲吧 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his cousin, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.49,0:33:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.22,0:33:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.02,0:33:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下午好 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.59,0:33:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.83,0:33:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉丢下您一人如此之久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry I have left you so much alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.08,0:33:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟议会有诸多国事要议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had much to do with Council and other matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.27,0:33:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 你知道 我的侄子 苏格兰国王詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as you know, my nephew, James, King of Scots,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.81,0:33:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不久将莅临到访\N{\fnArial\fs30}is due to visit here presently.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.64,0:33:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将签署一项和平条款\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are to sign a peace treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.42,0:33:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我们就直接回伦敦 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we shall straight back to London. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.94,0:33:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切谨遵陛下所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am at your Majesty's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.10,0:33:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.70,0:34:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说说 有没有怀上孩子的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now tell me, is there any sign that you may be with child?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.47,0:34:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.09,0:34:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说苏格兰国王要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear the King of Scotland is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.95,0:34:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约克这下可得挤满\N{\fnArial\fs30}York will be full of drunken Scots.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.75,0:34:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}身强力壮的苏格兰醉汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}with their brawny arms and togas.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.42,0:34:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士们你们可有福啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a boon for you ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.37,0:34:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐下 迪尔罕先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, Mr. Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.62,0:34:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 信儿给我送到了吗 - 送了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you send the message? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.40,0:34:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will he come?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.64,0:34:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们认识一个苏格兰人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew a Scot, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.58,0:34:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.31,0:34:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你记得吗 叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember? What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.03,0:35:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曼内克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manox.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.01,0:35:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你记得曼内克斯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember Manox?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.12,0:35:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.56,0:35:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪尔罕先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Dereham!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.84,0:35:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琼 你一定记得曼内克斯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joan, you must remember Manox?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.97,0:35:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你和他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you and he…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.44,0:35:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}够了 迪尔罕先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's quite enough, Mr. Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.06,0:35:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.84,0:35:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.58,0:35:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.79,0:35:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎敢如此无礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.35,0:35:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要报告国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall tell the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.88,0:35:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他该知道 他的妻子被她的仆从如此恶劣对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ought to know how beggardly his wife's servants treat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.90,0:35:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去你的 菲尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn you, Fell!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.41,0:35:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你去死 - 迪尔罕先生 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn you. - Mr. Dereham! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.96,0:35:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.17,0:36:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您在忙什么 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that, my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.02,0:36:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么 无聊之作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing. A trifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.98,0:36:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢说萨里伯爵的「无聊之作」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I daresay the Earl of Surrey's "Trifles" will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.51,0:36:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有朝一日会成为不朽篇章\N{\fnArial\fs30}someday be regarded as some of our greatest poesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.08,0:36:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我斗胆请大人过目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I daresay your Grace can read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.25,0:36:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以十四行诗的格式\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a translation, in sonnet form,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.74,0:36:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}翻译马提雅尔的铭词集\N{\fnArial\fs30}of one of Martial's epigrams.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.54,0:36:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这当然是罗马诗歌 但无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, of course, the Roman poet-but that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.73,0:36:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}描写的是和谐生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the happy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.62,0:36:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}中庸之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Golden Mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.54,0:36:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「乐活何处有 我自寻踪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The happy life be these, I find.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.45,0:36:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千金身外物 何须费心机\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The riches left, not got with pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.92,0:36:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春华待秋实 心静如止水\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The fruitful ground; the quiet mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.49,0:36:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}君子坦荡荡 小人长戚戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The equal friend; no grudge nor strife.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.36,0:36:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无法令之责 无铁腕之治\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No charge of rule nor governance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.98,0:36:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无疾病之忧 惟康健之体\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Without disease, the healthful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.70,0:36:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大智从率直\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wisdom joined with simplicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.40,0:37:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长夜无愁绪「\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The night discharged of all care."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.68,0:37:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心静如止水\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quiet mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.44,0:37:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长夜无愁绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night discharged of all care.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.77,0:37:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大智从率直\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wisdom joined with simplicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.75,0:37:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真令人无限向往\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, how I wish these things were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.21,0:37:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 诗中所言 您得享几样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which of these, your Grace, do you not have?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.22,0:37:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}样样皆无\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.88,0:37:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此 大人与我相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you are like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.90,0:37:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更有一切罗马公民\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like all the Romans.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.17,0:37:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切山野村夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the Barbarians.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.10,0:37:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前之古人 后之来者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the generations before us…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.08,0:37:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫不与你我相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all those yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.08,0:37:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心静如止水 此种境界\N{\fnArial\fs30}For who does not wish, or rest, with all their heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.31,0:37:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁不渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the quiet mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.32,0:37:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}试问这世上谁曾做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me a single soul who has ever found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.71,0:38:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.61,0:38:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说 你改变心意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've changed your mind, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.27,0:38:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.43,0:38:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说过 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.54,0:38:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了见你 我别无所求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I long for nothing so much as to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.79,0:38:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见不到你 我心若死灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes my heart die when I can't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.16,0:38:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.91,0:38:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于那个迪尔罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this Dereham…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.74,0:38:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得让他消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.52,0:38:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know. And I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.91,0:38:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证 回到伦敦就处理这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise. When we get back to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.86,0:38:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没生气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not still angry with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.22,0:38:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别生我的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't be angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.76,0:39:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿唯你是从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be at your commandment.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.83,0:39:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.55,0:39:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.04,0:39:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.22,0:39:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.68,0:40:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好极了 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes. That's it, my sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.15,0:40:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的小傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own sweet little fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.52,0:40:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是陛下送给苏格兰国王的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty's gift to the King of Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.18,0:41:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何事 速速报来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well! What do you have to say? Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.87,0:41:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.01,0:41:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏格兰国王并未践约\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King of Scotland is not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.84,0:41:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已返回爱丁堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has gone back to Edinburgh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.74,0:41:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更糟的是 愿神宽恕他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But worse! O that God could forgive them!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.87,0:42:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一支苏格兰军队悍然越境\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Scottish army has ridden over the border and is harrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.35,0:42:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大肆侵扰我国人民 烧抢掳掠\N{\fnArial\fs30}our people, spoiling fields, burning barns,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.38,0:42:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若有反抗 便大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and killing all those who oppose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.32,0:42:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.04,0:42:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下有何吩咐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.85,0:42:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你指挥我国边境驻军发动反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will order our troops on the border to retaliate,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.64,0:42:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以彼之道 还施彼身\N{\fnArial\fs30}with spoils, burnings and killings.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.06,0:42:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此仇当以三倍偿之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hurts to every one of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.21,0:42:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.98,0:42:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下 臣即刻去办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your Majesty. I am straight away to that business.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.14,0:43:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.24,0:43:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有事快报 否则斩下你的舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want? Speak or I will cut out your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.47,0:43:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}启禀陛下 您的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am to tell you that your son,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.20,0:43:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}身在温莎的爱德华王子现已病危\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince Edward, is dangerously ill at Windsor.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.95,0:43:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.28,0:44:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣父 请保佑我弟弟爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blessed Father, have mercy on my brother Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.66,0:44:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他系国家之希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui sedes ad dexteram Patris Filim.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.19,0:45:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.59,0:46:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 通知伦敦主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord, send for the Bishop of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.59,0:46:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他在王家教堂准备一场特别的弥撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to prepare a special Mass in the Chapel Royal,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.13,0:46:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢神佑朕的妻儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give thanks to God for my son and for my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.52,0:46:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.78,0:46:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus vobiscum.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.82,0:46:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神之精神永存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Et cum spiritu tuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.40,0:46:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以圣父 圣子\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the name of the Father, Son,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.41,0:46:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和圣灵的名义\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Holy Ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.24,0:46:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天 在所有圣徒面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this Day of All Saints,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.79,0:47:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下衷心感谢神赐佳偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}his Majesty wishes to thank God for blessing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.10,0:47:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完璧无瑕的凯瑟琳王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}with so perfect a companion as Queen Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.45,0:47:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诚如陛下所言\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his Majesty's own words:
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.82,0:47:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「主啊 我当感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I render thanks to Thee, O Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.14,0:47:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}历尽千般磨难\N{\fnArial\fs30}that after so many strange accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.49,0:47:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终有完美婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}that have befallen my marriages,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.13,0:47:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你欣然赐我娇妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thou hast been pleased to give me a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.07,0:47:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}佳人此刻在旁 全然合我心意「\N{\fnArial\fs30}so entirely conformed to my inclinations as her I now have."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.43,0:47:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此光荣圣所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaudeamus omnes in Domono,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.07,0:47:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普天同祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}diem festum celebrantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.97,0:47:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共庆佳节\N{\fnArial\fs30}sub honore sanctorum omnium…
